project project cases [] design  start 
style spacing  default StyleSpec { Stroke = , StrokeWidth = , Corner = , Pattern = , Fill = , IsEmpty = True }
circuit ladder 100 water neutral
component HE1 heat_exchanger in ladder at  tag 100HE01 style 
  out = 323.15 Temperature  
  power = 30000 Power  
component LOAD heat_exchanger in ladder at  tag 100HE02 style 
  power = -30000 Power  
component NR node in ladder at  tag  style 
component NS node in ladder at  tag  style 
component PU1 pump in ladder at  tag 100PU01 style 
component PU1__HE1 node in ladder at  tag  style 
component TC1 controller in ladder at  tag 100PID01 style 
  kp = 2 Dimensionless  
component TE_R t_sensor in ladder at NR tag 100TE02 style 
component TE_S t_sensor in ladder at NS tag 100TE01 style 
connection HE1.out -> NS.
connection LOAD.out -> NR.
connection NR. -> PU1.in
connection NS. -> LOAD.in
connection PU1.out -> PU1__HE1.
connection PU1__HE1. -> HE1.in
control TC1 moves PropertyReference { Component = PU1, Property = speed } reads PropertyReference { Component = TE_R, Property = t } setpoint 293.15 Temperature [] band - differential - output -..- curve 
